								"name": "WYSIWYG",
								"type": "wysiwyg_basic",
								"html": "<div style=\"color:#111111;\" class=\"rounded p-6 gap-3\"><h4 style=\"text-align:center;\">2026 Compassion In Action Program</h4>\n\n<h4 style=\"text-align:center;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Sponsored by Doctors Hospital of Augusta</span></h4>\n\n<h5 style=\"text-align:center;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Keynote Speaker: Susan Landreth-Everitt, Regional Chief Executive Officer of the South Carolina Red Cross</span></h5>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\n\t11:30 AM Doors Open\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\n\t11:45 AM Meal Service Begins\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\n\t11:55 AM Invocation by Major Jonathan Raymer\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\n\t12:00 PM Program Begins\n</p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li>Welcome by Jay Jeffries</li>\n\t<li>Behind the Shield Video</li>\n\t<li>Spirit of Service Award</li>\n\t<li>Annual Report presented by Belita Smith</li>\n\t<li>Advisory Board Award</li>\n\t<li>Joy Lives at the Center of Hope</li>\n\t<li>Battle of the Bells Award</li>\n\t<li>Joseph Herzberg Employee of the Year Award</li>\n\t<li>A Message from the Board</li>\n\t<li>Keynote Address by Susan Landreth-Everitt</li>\n\t<li>Volunteer of the Year Award</li>\n\t<li>Concluding Remarks by Jay Jefferies</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\n\t1:00 PM Program Concludes\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\n\t \n</p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\n\t \n</p>\n\n<h4 style=\"text-align:center;\">Ways to Give</h4>\n\n<div class=\"btgrid\">\n\t<div class=\"row row-1\">\n\t\t<div class=\"col-lg-6 col-md-12 col-sm-12\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"content\">\n\t\t\t\t<p style=\"text-align:center;\" class=\"cta-button-group d-flex flex-wrap gap-2 my-3 justify-content-center\"><a href=\"https://give.salvationarmygeorgia.org/campaign/769689/donate\" class=\"btn btn-primary gap-1 mt-2\">Donate</a></p>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"col-lg-6 col-md-12 col-sm-12\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"content\">\n\t\t\t\t<p style=\"text-align:center;\" class=\"cta-button-group d-flex flex-wrap gap-2 my-3 justify-content-center\"><a href=\"https://salvationarmyaugusta.galaxydigital.com/\" class=\"btn btn-secondary gap-1 mt-2\">Volunteer</a></p>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n</div>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\n\t<span style=\"font-size:16px;\">This story is just one example of the impact happening every day at the Center of Hope. As we work to open a new Center of Hope, we need your voice as much as your support. Please consider sharing our campaign site with your network. </span>\n</p>\n\n<h5 style=\"text-align:center;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"></span></h5></div>",
								"content": "<div style=\"color:#111111;\" class=\"rounded p-6 gap-3\"><h4 style=\"text-align:center;\">2026 Compassion In Action Program</h4>\n\n<h4 style=\"text-align:center;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Sponsored by Doctors Hospital of Augusta</span></h4>\n\n<h5 style=\"text-align:center;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Keynote Speaker: Susan Landreth-Everitt, Regional Chief Executive Officer of the South Carolina Red Cross</span></h5>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\n\t11:30 AM Doors Open\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\n\t11:45 AM Meal Service Begins\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\n\t11:55 AM Invocation by Major Jonathan Raymer\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\n\t12:00 PM Program Begins\n</p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li>Welcome by Jay Jeffries</li>\n\t<li>Behind the Shield Video</li>\n\t<li>Spirit of Service Award</li>\n\t<li>Annual Report presented by Belita Smith</li>\n\t<li>Advisory Board Award</li>\n\t<li>Joy Lives at the Center of Hope</li>\n\t<li>Battle of the Bells Award</li>\n\t<li>Joseph Herzberg Employee of the Year Award</li>\n\t<li>A Message from the Board</li>\n\t<li>Keynote Address by Susan Landreth-Everitt</li>\n\t<li>Volunteer of the Year Award</li>\n\t<li>Concluding Remarks by Jay Jefferies</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\n\t1:00 PM Program Concludes\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\n\t \n</p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\n\t \n</p>\n\n<h4 style=\"text-align:center;\">Ways to Give</h4>\n\n<div class=\"btgrid\">\n\t<div class=\"row row-1\">\n\t\t<div class=\"col-lg-6 col-md-12 col-sm-12\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"content\">\n\t\t\t\t<p style=\"text-align:center;\" class=\"cta-button-group d-flex flex-wrap gap-2 my-3 justify-content-center\"><a href=\"https://give.salvationarmygeorgia.org/campaign/769689/donate\" class=\"btn btn-primary gap-1 mt-2\">Donate</a></p>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"col-lg-6 col-md-12 col-sm-12\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"content\">\n\t\t\t\t<p style=\"text-align:center;\" class=\"cta-button-group d-flex flex-wrap gap-2 my-3 justify-content-center\"><a href=\"https://salvationarmyaugusta.galaxydigital.com/\" class=\"btn btn-secondary gap-1 mt-2\">Volunteer</a></p>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n</div>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\n\t<span style=\"font-size:16px;\">This story is just one example of the impact happening every day at the Center of Hope. As we work to open a new Center of Hope, we need your voice as much as your support. Please consider sharing our campaign site with your network. </span>\n</p>\n\n<h5 style=\"text-align:center;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"></span></h5></div>",
