t\">\n\t\t\t\t<p style=\"text-align:center;\" class=\"cta-button-group d-flex flex-wrap gap-2 my-3 justify-content-center\"><a href=\"https://salvationarmyaugusta.galaxydigital.com/\" class=\"btn btn-light\">Volunteer</a></p>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n</div>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\n\t<span style=\"font-size:16px;\">This story is just one example of the impact happening every day at the Center of Hope. As we work to open a new Center of Hope, we need your voice as much as your support. Please consider sharing our campaign site with your network. </span>\n</p>\n\n<h5 style=\"text-align:center;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"></span></h5></div>"
